  "prefLabel": "Par 104.03 Exceptions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Par 104.03 Exceptions. The following information shall be provided in individual cases, upon specific written request by any person:\n\n(a) The dates of sentence and commitment, parole eligibility date, mandatory release date, or termination of sentence; and\n\n(b) Whether an inmate is being considered for parole, has been paroled or not, and, if the inmate has been paroled, the effective date set by the board.\n\nSource. #7148, eff 12-7-99 (from Par 103.03); ss by #12157, eff 4-7-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/par100-500.html"
